  "type": "Album + Compilation",
  "description": "Everything So Far is the first compilation album by American rock band Pinegrove. It was initially self-released by the band in 2014, and later released on cassette as a tour-only exclusive by Seagreen Records in December 2014. Everything So Far serves as an anthology the band's early material, from self-released extended plays to the band's first proper album, Meridian. Following Pinegrove's signing to independent record label Run for Cover, it was re-released with updated cover art on October 9, 2015. It has since seen re-released on vinyl and compact disc.",
